            text: _("As I destroyed your son, I now destroy you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("You were always defiant, wizard, and no one has thwarted my plans as determinedly as you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I have always been a humble servant of the Crown, and remain such even now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Asheviere",
            portrait: "portraits/asheviere-defeated.webp",
            text: _("Delfador! You utterly disgust me, you sniveling worm. How dare you confront me, your queen?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mad.webp",
            text: _("How dare I? I, High Provost of the Council of Archmagi... _ ... bearer of the staff of An-Usrukhar, guardian of the book of Crelanu ... _ ... Mage Protector of The Kingdom Of The Peoples Of The West-North, Chief Advisor to the Crown... _ ... and personal counselor to my King and my friend, Garard the Second, whom you most foully betrayed... _ I am Delfador the Great and TODAY YOU MEET YOUR ATONEMENT!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "lightning.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: "$unit.x",
            y: "$($unit.y-2)",
            item_name: "",
            image: "halo%2Flightning-bolt-2-%5B1~4%5D.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "epilogue",
          },
        ],
      },
