      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_360",
        on: "branch_if_360",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "bm_weldyn_pillage",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-glad.webp",
            text: _("The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons and a daughter."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("They ruled wisely, but some wounds are slow to heal. The croplands surrounding Weldyn would never entirely recover from their razing. The people there grew hard and bitter; that land spawned many outlaws."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("But such was the cost of victory, wasn’t it?"),
          },
        ],
      },
