            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/lisar-glad.webp",
            text: _("The prince and the queen’s mutual respect grew into friendship, trust, and eventually something more. They were married, and together they had two sons and a daughter. The kingdom once more prospered under their rule."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("All was well."),
          },
        ],
      },
